      "content": "it doesn't feel like a staircase though. it feels like a wall. like no matter how many steps i take, the wall just gets higher. everything i do to try and fix it just makes it worse. i'm so tired of fighting for a life that i can't even afford to live. it feels like it would just be easier to stop. just stop everything.",
